IN MAKEUP.

218
00:09:37,715 --> 00:09:38,950
IT'S A LIVING HELL FOR ME.

219
00:09:38,950 --> 00:09:40,218
I'M NOT A MEMORIZER.

220
00:09:40,218 --> 00:09:41,352
I'VE NEVER
HAVE BEEN ONE.

221
00:09:41,352 --> 00:09:42,720
A COVER GIRL'S LIFE
CAN SEEM--

222
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:46,090
COVER GIRL--
MAKEUP MELTDOWN--

223
00:09:46,090 --> 00:09:47,325
I'M SORRY.

224
00:09:47,325 --> 00:09:50,662
A COVER GIRL'S LIFE CAN SEEM--
MILK UP MAKE--

225
00:09:50,662 --> 00:09:52,196
MILK UP?

226
00:09:52,196 --> 00:09:53,498
OKAY, CAN I START OVER?

227
00:09:53,498 --> 00:09:55,833
MAKEUP MELTDOWN
BECAME MILKSHAKE.

228
00:09:55,833 --> 00:09:57,835
ONE STEP NOW TO ALL-DAY--

229
00:09:57,835 --> 00:09:59,937
JEEZ LOUIS-US.

230
00:09:59,937 --> 00:10:01,272
I ALREADY FORGOT THE LINES.

231
00:10:01,272 --> 00:10:03,908
AND IT'S JUST
SO MUCH AT ONE TIME THAT I'M

232
00:10:03,908 --> 00:10:05,777
JUST KIND OF GOING CRAZY
AND JUST LOST IT ALL.

233
00:10:18,222 --> 00:10:19,223
IT WAS TERRIBLE FOR ME.

234
00:10:19,223 --> 00:10:20,391
ME, TOO.

235
00:10:20,391 --> 00:10:23,328
TO ME, MAKEUP MELTDOWN
WAS SOMETHING, LIKE,

236
00:10:23,328 --> 00:10:24,595
I DON'T EVEN KNOW.

237
00:10:24,595 --> 00:10:26,531
SO, TODAY, NOT ONLY
WERE WE DOING A COMMERCIAL

238
00:10:26,531 --> 00:10:30,001
BUT WE'RE ALSO DOING A BEAUTY
SHOT FOR COVER GIRL.

239
00:10:30,001 --> 00:10:33,204
YOU KNOW BEAUTY SHOTS
ARE THE MOST DIFFICULT.

240
00:10:33,204 --> 00:10:34,605
BE YOU.

241
00:10:34,605 --> 00:10:38,109
IF YOU CAN BE YOU IN THE CAMERA,
THAT'S A COVER GIRL SHOT.

242
00:10:38,109 --> 00:10:40,845
A BEAUTY SHOT IS BASICALLY
A VERY TIGHT FRAME ON THE FACE,

243
00:10:40,845 --> 00:10:43,681
AND IT'S JUST TO REVEAL
YOUR NATURAL BEAUTY.

244
00:10:43,681 --> 00:10:46,284
I FEEL LIKE A HAND, A HAND,
A HAND, A HEAD, A HEAD.

245
00:10:46,284 --> 00:10:49,187
JUST WORK IT IN THROUGH THERE.

246
00:10:49,187 --> 00:10:50,588
AND DON'T LOSE YOUR NECK.

247
00:10:50,588 --> 00:10:53,091
IT IS A LOT OF PRESSURE
DOING A COVER GIRL COSMETICS

248
00:10:53,091 --> 00:10:55,760
COMMERCIAL, BECAUSE THIS COULD
POSSIBLY BE MY FUTURE EMPLOYER.

249
00:10:57,762 --> 00:10:59,397
KEENYAH GAVE ME
THE RIGHT SMILE,

250
00:10:59,397 --> 00:11:01,599
BUT IT JUST GOT STUCK THERE.

251
00:11:04,235 --> 00:11:06,738
IMAGINE THAT THING WHEN YOU
GET TO THE END OF THE RUNWAY,

252
00:11:06,738 --> 00:11:09,440
AND THERE'S A CERTAIN ENERGY
THAT'S THERE.

253
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:11,042
MOST OF THE PHOTO SHOOTS
THAT WE DID BEFORE

254
00:11:11,042 --> 00:11:12,276
WERE KIND OF FIERCE.

255
00:11:12,276 --> 00:11:15,313
FOR COVER GIRL,
IT'S JUST SMILE AND BE HAPPY.

256
00:11:15,313 --> 00:11:16,647
THAT'S A LOT HARDER.

257
00:11:16,647 --> 00:11:20,518
NAIMA, SOMETHING LIKE THIS
IS SO WIDE I NEED IT TO BE

258
00:11:20,518 --> 00:11:21,753
A LITTLE MORE LIKE--

259
00:11:21,753 --> 00:11:23,554
EXACTLY, BEAUTIFUL.

260
00:11:23,554 --> 00:11:25,390
THIS IS A MAKE-OR-BREAK
SHOOT FOR ME TODAY.

261
00:11:25,390 --> 00:11:28,659
I NEED TO HAVE MY PHOTOGRAPHS
COME OUT VERY WELL.

262
00:11:28,659 --> 00:11:31,362
I'M REALLY NERVOUS,
BUT I NEVER GIVE UP.

263
00:11:31,362 --> 00:11:32,463
BELLISSIMA.

264
00:11:33,798 --> 00:11:37,402
I DID SO HORRIBLE
WITH THE COVER GIRL COMMERCIAL.

265
00:11:37,402 --> 00:11:40,471
THE BEAUTY SHOT IS GIVING ME
A CHANCE TO REDEEM MYSELF.

266
00:11:40,471 --> 00:11:42,907
IT'S A VERY TIGHT SHOT, SO
YOU NEED LITTLE POSES LIKE THIS,

267
00:11:42,907 --> 00:11:44,275
A LITTLE COY, A LITTLE SMILE.

268
00:11:44,275 --> 00:11:45,443
GOT IT.

269
00:11:46,944 --> 00:11:49,280
I DO KIND OF TRANSFORM WHEN
I GET IN FRONT OF THE CAMERA,

270
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:53,217
'CAUSE IT GIVES ME A CHANCE
TO SHOW MY GIRLIE SIDE.

271
00:11:53,217 --> 00:11:54,986
HEY, KAHLEN, YOU CAN GIVE ME
LITTLE SMALLER CHANGES

272
00:11:54,986 --> 00:11:57,021
LIKE BAM, BAM.

273
00:11:57,021 --> 00:11:58,556
BAM, BAM.

274
00:11:58,556 --> 00:11:59,757
BAM.

275
00:11:59,757 --> 00:12:01,025
OKAY, GIVE ME A BAM.

276
00:12:01,025 --> 00:12:02,460
BAM, A GIGGLE.

277
00:12:02,460 --> 00:12:03,494
COME ON, KAHLEN.

278
00:12:03,494 --> 00:12:04,896
KEEP IT GIGGLING.

279
00:12:04,896 --> 00:12:06,297
IT'S A COMBINATION OF YOU
HAVE TO FART, BUT YOU'RE GONNA

280
00:12:06,297 --> 00:12:08,299
SMILE AT THE SAME TIME.

281
00:12:08,299 --> 00:12:09,634
PRETTY, LOOK.

282
00:12:09,634 --> 00:12:11,736
LOOK, FART AND GIGGLE WORKED.

283
00:12:11,736 --> 00:12:13,971
GOOD JOB, KAHLEN.

284
00:12:13,971 --> 00:12:15,006
IT'S A WRAP.

285
00:12:15,006 --> 00:12:16,574
IT'S A WRAP, YES.

286
00:12:18,376 --> 00:12:19,410
HEY.

287
00:12:19,410 --> 00:12:20,745
YOU DIDN'T SEE THIS TYRA MAIL?

288
00:12:22,413 --> 00:12:24,649
"TOMORROW YOU MEET
WITH THE JUDGES.

289
00:12:24,649 --> 00:12:28,386
ONLY TWO OF YOU WILL CONTINUE ON
IN HOPES OF BECOMING

290
00:12:28,386 --> 00:12:30,321
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

291
00:12:30,321 --> 00:12:32,490
ONE OF YOU WILL
BE ELIMINATED."

292
00:12:32,490 --> 00:12:35,159
I FEEL LIKE MY COMPETITION
RIGHT NOW IS PROBABLY NAIMA,

293
00:12:35,159 --> 00:12:37,061
BECAUSE THE JUDGES
SEE SOMETHING SPECIAL IN HER

294
00:12:37,061 --> 00:12:39,197
THAT I REALLY DON'T SEE.

295
00:12:39,197 --> 00:12:41,766
I HAVE FELT THAT I NEED
TO PUT ON A FRONT

296
00:12:41,766 --> 00:12:44,135
FOR THE JUDGES
IN ORDER TO CONTINUE

297
00:12:44,135 --> 00:12:45,369
THROUGHOUT THE COMPETITION.

298
00:12:45,369 --> 00:12:50,475
BUT I REALIZED
WHAT THE JUDGES WANTED WAS ME.

299
00:12:50,475 --> 00:12:52,376
I THINK THAT KAHLEN
IS STRUGGLING A LOT.

300
00:12:52,376 --> 00:12:54,011
SHE HAS BEEN SLIDING
IN THE PAST TWO WEEKS

301
00:12:54,011 --> 00:12:55,646
WHEN IT COMES TO HER PHOTOS.

302
00:12:55,646 --> 00:12:57,482
THE PHOTOGRAPHS DON'T EVEN
MATTER THAT MUCH ANYMORE.

303
00:12:57,482 --> 00:12:58,783
IT'S MORE ABOUT PERFORMANCE.

304
00:12:58,783 --> 00:13:01,152
MY PERFORMANCE WASN'T
OUTSTANDING AT ALL.

305
00:13:01,152 --> 00:13:02,420
I THINK
FOR TOMORROW'S ELIMINATION

306
00:13:02,420 --> 00:13:03,588
I'M THE ONE GOING HOME.

307
00:13:12,230 --> 00:13:13,598
WELCOME, LADIES.

308
00:13:13,598 --> 00:13:15,800
WOW, THE FINAL THREE.

309
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:18,669
WELL, NOW IT'S TIME TO MAKE OUR
12TH CUT, WHICH WILL BRING US

310
00:13:18,669 --> 00:13:21,639
ONE STEP CLOSER TOWARDS
DETERMINING WHO WILL BECOME

311
00:13:21,639 --> 00:13:24,242
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

312
00:13:24,242 --> 00:13:25,710
NOW YOU GUYS KNOW
ABOUT THESE PRIZES.

313
00:13:25,710 --> 00:13:27,879
YOU'VE BEEN HEARING ABOUT THEM
EVERY SINGLE WEEK.

314
00:13:27,879 --> 00:13:30,147
THE FIRST IS A CONTRACT
FROM TOP INTERNATIONAL MODEL

315
00:13:30,147 --> 00:13:32,617
MANAGEMENT COMPANY--
FORD MODELS--

316
00:13:32,617 --> 00:13:34,385
A PHOTO SPREAD IN "ELLE"
MAGAZINE

317
00:13:34,385 --> 00:13:38,389
SHOT BY WORLD-RENOWNED
PHOTOGRAPHER, GILLES BESIMON,

318
00:13:38,389 --> 00:13:43,060
AND A $100,000 CONTRACT
FROM COVER GIRL COSMETICS.

319
00:13:43,060 --> 00:13:44,328
AND OUR JUDGES, OF COURSE--

320
00:13:44,328 --> 00:13:45,596
MISS JANICE DICKINSON,

321
00:13:45,596 --> 00:13:47,231
ONE OF THE WORLD'S FIRST
SUPERMODELS,

322
00:13:47,231 --> 00:13:49,800
NIGEL BARKER
A NOTED FASHION PHOTOGRAPHER,

323
00:13:49,800 --> 00:13:53,237
NOLé MARIN PROMINENT
FASHION EDITOR AND STYLIST

324
00:13:53,237 --> 00:13:54,772
AND GRETHA SCHOLTZ.

325
00:13:54,772 --> 00:13:56,707
GRETHA IS THE DESIGNER
OF POISON IVY,

326
00:13:56,707 --> 00:13:58,876
WHICH IS AN AMAZING
BATHING SUIT LINE

327
00:13:58,876 --> 00:14:01,512
HERE IN SOUTH AFRICA.

328
00:14:01,512 --> 00:14:04,015
THE TWO GIRLS LEFT STANDING
AT THE END OF THE NIGHT,

329
00:14:04,015 --> 00:14:08,553
WILL BE THE TWO GIRLS WALKING IN
THE ULTIMATE RUNWAY FASHION SHOW

330
00:14:08,553 --> 00:14:11,522
WITH THREE OF CAPE TOWN'S
TOP FASHION DESIGNERS--

331
00:14:11,522 --> 00:14:14,292
GRETHA'S POISON IVY LINE
BEING ONE OF THEM.

332
00:14:14,292 --> 00:14:16,093
CAN I BE IN THE SHOW, PLEASE?

333
00:14:16,093 --> 00:14:17,094
PLEASE?

334
00:14:17,094 --> 00:14:18,496
TONIGHT,
YOU'RE GONNA BE JUDGED

335
00:14:18,496 --> 00:14:22,733
ON THREE DIFFERENT THINGS--
THE FIRST IS THE COMMERCIAL

336
00:14:22,733 --> 00:14:27,171
FROM COVER GIRL COSMETICS,
THE NEXT IS YOUR RUNWAY WALK,

337
00:14:27,171 --> 00:14:30,741
AND THE LAST IS YOUR PHOTO FROM
YOUR COVER GIRL PHOTO SHOOT.

338
00:14:30,741 --> 00:14:34,879
SO YOU GUYS DID A COMMERCIAL
AND HERE IT IS.

339
00:14:40,551 --> 00:14:42,987
A COVER GIRL'S LIFE
IS A FRANTIC PACE

340
00:14:42,987 --> 00:14:44,989
AND WILL MAKE YOU FEEL
LIKE A RACE.

341
00:14:44,989 --> 00:14:45,990
MAKEUP MELTDOWN?

342
00:14:45,990 --> 00:14:47,258
NOT ON THIS FACE.

343
00:14:47,258 --> 00:14:50,461
ONLY FROM COVER GIRL--
NEW OUTLAST MAKEUP.

344
00:14:50,461 --> 00:14:53,297
TWO STEPS NOW--
TO ALL-DAY WOW.

345
00:14:53,297 --> 00:14:56,200
ONE, THE PREP STEP
SMOOTHES THE PORES.

346
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:57,969
SHINE IS GONE.

347
00:14:57,969 --> 00:15:00,771
TWO, THE MAKEUP STAYS FRESH,
STAYS FLAWLESS,

348
00:15:00,771 --> 00:15:02,239
STAYS ON.

349
00:15:02,239 --> 00:15:04,108
WHILE THE REST OF THE DAY
MAY GO WRONG--

350
00:15:04,108 --> 00:15:05,209
CHECK OUT THE NEW STEP--

351
00:15:05,209 --> 00:15:06,877
TWO-STEP OUTLAST MAKEUP.

352
00:15:06,877 --> 00:15:08,613
IT IS THE FRESH WORD
IN MAKEUP.

353
00:15:08,613 --> 00:15:12,216
AND IT'S ONLY FROM EASY,
BREEZY BEAUTIFUL COVER GIRL.

354
00:15:12,216 --> 00:15:13,217
THAT WAS REALLY COOL.

355
00:15:13,217 --> 00:15:14,552
SO FIRST IS NAIMA.

356
00:15:14,552 --> 00:15:17,455
YOUR BEST, STRONGEST RUNWAY WALK
THAT YOU HAVE LEARNED.

357
00:15:20,424 --> 00:15:23,127
NAIMA,
YOUR LEGS LOOKED GUMBY.

358
00:15:23,127 --> 00:15:25,896
IF THAT'S YOUR SIGNATURE WALK,
I'D CHANGE IT IMMEDIATELY.

359
00:15:25,896 --> 00:15:27,999
ALL RIGHT, NAIMA,
SO YOU HAD A PHOTO SHOOT

360
00:15:27,999 --> 00:15:29,967
FOR COVER GIRL COSMETICS.

361
00:15:29,967 --> 00:15:33,004
SO LET'S SEE YOUR BEST SHOT.

362
00:15:33,004 --> 00:15:34,038
DRUM ROLL, PLEASE.

363
00:15:36,507 --> 00:15:38,009
THAT'S BEAUTIFUL.
OH, WOW.

364
00:15:38,009 --> 00:15:39,910
YOU HAVE A NATURAL SPARK.

365
00:15:39,910 --> 00:15:43,247
THIS PHOTOGRAPH
YOU CAN SEE IN ANY MAGAZINE

366
00:15:43,247 --> 00:15:45,683
FROM "VOGUE" TO "ALLURE"
TO "GLAMOUR."

367
00:15:45,683 --> 00:15:48,719
THIS PHOTOGRAPH IS ROCKIN',
GIRL.

368
00:15:48,719 --> 00:15:51,222
OVER ALL, IT'S A NICE SHOT.

369
00:15:51,222 --> 00:15:53,324
BUT IT'S NOT
SLAM DUNK FOR ME.

370
00:15:53,324 --> 00:15:55,593
SO YOU GUYS DID A COMMERCIAL.

371
00:15:55,593 --> 00:15:58,329
ONLY FROM COVER GIRL
NEW OUTLAST MAKEUP.

372
00:15:58,329 --> 00:15:59,697
NAIMA, I WAS BLOWN AWAY.

373
00:15:59,697 --> 00:16:01,666
YOU WERE THE SPECIAL SPICE
IN THAT COMMERCIAL.

374
00:16:01,666 --> 00:16:03,167
I WASN'T SO SURE
IF YOU COULD PULL IT OFF,

375
00:16:03,167 --> 00:16:06,003
BECAUSE YOU'RE THE EDGY GIRL,
THE MYSTERIOUS GIRL,

376
00:16:06,003 --> 00:16:08,239
BUT YOU LOOK SO COMMERCIAL
AND SO RELATABLE.

377
00:16:08,239 --> 00:16:09,573
I'M, LIKE, SHOCKED
'CAUSE I DIDN'T THINK

378
00:16:09,573 --> 00:16:11,509
YOU COULD DO THIS HONESTLY.

379
00:16:11,509 --> 00:16:13,878
NAIMA, WHY HAVEN'T
WE SEEN THIS ENERGY

380
00:16:13,878 --> 00:16:16,414
OR THIS TYPE OF BEAUTY BEFORE?

381
00:16:16,414 --> 00:16:22,119
I WANTED TO SUPPRESS A PAST
THAT I'M NOT COMFORTABLE WITH.

382
00:16:22,119 --> 00:16:27,158
AND SUPPRESSING THAT ONE THING
INSIDE OF ME, MADE ME SUPPRESS

383
00:16:27,158 --> 00:16:28,793
EVERYTHING ELSE.

384
00:16:28,793 --> 00:16:30,094
IT'S THE PAST.

385
00:16:30,094 --> 00:16:31,195
LEARN FROM IT.

386
00:16:31,195 --> 00:16:33,197
IT'S "O" - "V,"
OVER, BABY.

387
00:16:35,266 --> 00:16:37,968
I SEE A COMPLETE JOURNEY
OF A PERSON,

388
00:16:37,968 --> 00:16:40,304
AND I AM REALLY PROUD OF YOU.

389
00:16:40,304 --> 00:16:41,972
ALL RIGHT, KEENYAH,
SO GIVE US A WALK.

390
00:16:45,710 --> 00:16:47,211
I LOVE,
REALLY LOVE, THE ENERGY

391
00:16:47,211 --> 00:16:48,746
YOU'VE BEEN GIVING US,
BUT THE WALK

392
00:16:48,746 --> 00:16:50,114
I THINK NEEDS A BIT WORK.

393
00:16:50,114 --> 00:16:52,683
SO YOU DID A PHOTO SHOOT
FOR COVER GIRL COSMETICS,

394
00:16:52,683 --> 00:16:53,984
AND HERE IS YOUR BEST SHOT.

395
00:16:55,219 --> 00:16:56,387
OH, WOW.

396
00:16:56,387 --> 00:16:58,189
IT REALLY WORKS WELL HERE.

397
00:16:58,189 --> 00:17:00,458
YOU LOOK REALLY COMMANDING.

398
00:17:00,458 --> 00:17:01,759
YOU NEED MORE OF A NECK.

399
00:17:01,759 --> 00:17:03,360
TO ME IT'S NOT
A COVER GIRL SHOT.

400
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:05,696
I ALWAYS DO THAT
SHOULDER ON MY CHIN.

401
00:17:05,696 --> 00:17:08,232
THAT'S, LIKE,
ONE OF MY SIGNATURE MOVES, THE--

402
00:17:08,232 --> 00:17:10,468
WELL, I THINK THAT EVERYONE
WILL DISAGREE ON THE POSE,

403
00:17:10,468 --> 00:17:12,870
BUT I'M GONNA GO STRAIGHT OUT
AND GO BUY SOME COVER GIRL.

404
00:17:12,870 --> 00:17:15,039
WE ALL NEED THAT MAKEUP
TO MAKE US LOOK LIKE THAT.

405
00:17:15,039 --> 00:17:17,907
SO, KEENYAH, WE'RE GONNA
FOCUS ON THE COMMERCIAL NOW.

406
00:17:17,907 --> 00:17:19,710
RUNWAY CAN FEEL LIKE A RACE.

407
00:17:19,710 --> 00:17:24,582
DID YOU GET A SENSE
OF YOUR INNER BEAUTY AT ALL?

408
00:17:24,582 --> 00:17:26,150
IT WAS MEDIOCRE.

409
00:17:26,150 --> 00:17:28,118
WOW, I MUST BE WATCHING
A DIFFERENT COMMERCIAL,

410
00:17:28,118 --> 00:17:30,320
'CAUSE I ACTUALLY THOUGHT
THIS IS YOUR FORTE.

411
00:17:30,320 --> 00:17:31,822
YOU'VE GOT A GREAT
NATURAL SMILE.

412
00:17:31,822 --> 00:17:33,524
ALL RIGHT, KEENYAH, THANKS.

413
00:17:33,524 --> 00:17:34,925
THANK YOU.

414
00:17:34,925 --> 00:17:36,127
KAHLEN.

415
00:17:38,829 --> 00:17:40,965
KAHLEN, DO YOU HOLD
YOUR BREATH WHEN YOU'RE WALKING?

416
00:17:40,965 --> 00:17:42,433
SOMETIMES
I FORGET TO BREATHE.

417
00:17:42,433 --> 00:17:43,601
YOU HAVE TO REMEMBER
THAT ON THE RUNWAY

418
00:17:43,601 --> 00:17:45,469
THEY'RE STILL CONSTANTLY
TAKING PICTURES OF YOU.

419
00:17:45,469 --> 00:17:47,471
SO EVEN THOUGH YOUR BODY MIGHT
BE DOING ALL THIS FIERCENESS,

420
00:17:47,471 --> 00:17:50,574
IF YOUR FACE IS LIKE,
THAT PICTURE'S NOT GONNA RUN.

421
00:17:50,574 --> 00:17:53,210
KAHLEN, YOU HAD A PHOTO SHOOT
FOR COVER GIRL,

422
00:17:53,210 --> 00:17:54,645
AND HERE IS YOUR BEST SHOT.

423
00:17:57,148 --> 00:18:00,184
OH, YOU KNOW WHAT,
YOU'VE NEVER LOOKED LIKE THAT.

424
00:18:00,184 --> 00:18:03,220
THAT JUST REEKS COVER GIRL,
BABY GIRL.

425
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:05,623
KAHLEN, WHERE IS THIS GIRL?

426
00:18:05,623 --> 00:18:07,925
WHY ISN'T THIS SMILE,
LIKE, PLANTED ON YOUR FACE

427
00:18:07,925 --> 00:18:09,493
FROM THE MOMENT YOU WALK IN?

428
00:18:09,493 --> 00:18:10,895
I DON'T KNOW, GUYS.

429
00:18:10,895 --> 00:18:11,896
I DON'T LIKE THIS PICTURE.

430
00:18:11,896 --> 00:18:13,097
I LIKE THE PHOTO.

431
00:18:13,097 --> 00:18:14,965
IT DOESN'T LOOK LIKE
A COSMETIC AD TO ME.

432
00:18:14,965 --> 00:18:16,600
I SEE SOMETHING
MY 10-YEAR-OLD DAUGHTER

433
00:18:16,600 --> 00:18:17,968
WOULD RUN OUT AND BUY.

434
00:18:17,968 --> 00:18:19,436
I DON'T KNOW.
IT LOOKS LIKE--

435
00:18:19,436 --> 00:18:20,471
INSTEAD OF--

436
00:18:20,471 --> 00:18:21,639
I SEE IT ALL--

437
00:18:21,639 --> 00:18:24,141
A GORGEOUS NOSE, LONG NECK,
BEAUTIFUL SKIN.

438
00:18:24,141 --> 00:18:25,976
ALL RIGHT, KAHLEN, SO YOU HAD
A COMMERCIAL FOR COVER GIRL,

439
00:18:25,976 --> 00:18:28,412
AND NOW WE ARE GOING TO
LOOK AT YOU.

440
00:18:28,412 --> 00:18:31,682
THE MAKEUP STAYS FRESH,
STAYS FLAWLESS, STAYS ON.

