ALL RIGHT, GIRLS,
LET'S WORK IT OUT!

666
00:28:24,975 --> 00:28:26,009
I'M STANDING IN LINE.

667
00:28:26,009 --> 00:28:27,210
I'M WAITING.

668
00:28:27,210 --> 00:28:28,178
I'VE GOT ANXIETY.

669
00:28:28,178 --> 00:28:29,246
I'VE GOT BUTTERFLIES.

670
00:28:29,246 --> 00:28:30,514
I'M JUST LIKE,
"OKAY LET'S GO.

671
00:28:30,514 --> 00:28:31,515
LET'S GET THIS ON."

672
00:28:31,515 --> 00:28:36,553
OKAY, IN FIVE, FOUR,
THREE, TWO,

673
00:28:36,553 --> 00:28:37,554
CUE MUSIC!

674
00:28:39,756 --> 00:28:40,824
WORK IT!

675
00:28:47,831 --> 00:28:48,899
COME ON, NAIMA,
THIS IS YOUR TIME.

676
00:28:48,899 --> 00:28:50,066
GIVE ME A HIGH-FIVE, GIRL.

677
00:29:02,345 --> 00:29:04,581
I CAN GLANCE DOWN
AND SEE MY FEET STOMPING

678
00:29:04,581 --> 00:29:06,349
THROUGH THE WATER.

679
00:29:06,349 --> 00:29:08,385
I FEEL SUPERHUMAN.

680
00:29:10,520 --> 00:29:11,521
LET'S GO, KAHLEN.

681
00:29:11,521 --> 00:29:12,522
LET'S GO.

682
00:29:12,522 --> 00:29:13,457
WORK IT OUT.

683
00:29:17,594 --> 00:29:18,628
THAT'S MY GIRL.

684
00:29:18,628 --> 00:29:20,297
THAT'S MY GIRL!

685
00:29:20,297 --> 00:29:22,132
I HIT THAT FIRST POSE
AND I FEEL THIS

686
00:29:22,132 --> 00:29:24,734
JUST HUGE ADRENALIN RUSH.

687
00:29:24,734 --> 00:29:27,404
AND I CAN FEEL MY HEART
GETTING READY TO EXPLODE.

688
00:29:30,407 --> 00:29:32,209
THAT LOOKS AWESOME.

689
00:29:32,209 --> 00:29:34,411
I NEED SOME EVENING
GOWNS COMING UP.

690
00:29:34,411 --> 00:29:36,947
THE SCENE BACKSTAGE
IS JUST COMPLETE CHAOS.

691
00:29:36,947 --> 00:29:39,816
WHY IS THAT TAKING SO LONG?

692
00:29:49,159 --> 00:29:51,194
I CAN KIND OF
SEE THE JUDGES.

693
00:29:51,194 --> 00:29:53,063
I HEAR THEM SCREAMING.

694
00:29:56,433 --> 00:29:58,902
COME ON, KAHLEN!

695
00:29:58,902 --> 00:30:00,203
WORK IT OUT!

696
00:30:01,905 --> 00:30:03,740
NOT ONLY AM I STOMPING
ON ALL THOSE PEOPLE

697
00:30:03,740 --> 00:30:06,676
THAT DIDN'T BELIEVE IN ME,
I'M STOMPING ON THAT GIRL

698
00:30:06,676 --> 00:30:08,278
THAT DOESN'T BELIEVE IN HERSELF.

699
00:30:14,150 --> 00:30:15,819
THIS IS YOUR
LAST PASS GIRLS.

700
00:30:15,819 --> 00:30:17,220
THIS IS THE BIG WALK.

701
00:30:17,220 --> 00:30:19,322
THIS IS THE ONE WHERE THE JUDGES
ARE GONNA BE COMPARING US

702
00:30:19,322 --> 00:30:20,624
TO EACH OTHER.

703
00:30:20,624 --> 00:30:23,460
I'M GONNA NEED NAIMA
AND KAHLEN RIGHT NEXT TO ME.

704
00:30:23,460 --> 00:30:24,928
I'M GONNA WALK DOWN
THAT RUNWAY

705
00:30:24,928 --> 00:30:28,064
AND LOOK KAHLEN DEAD IN THE EYE
AND SAY, "LOOK, BITCH,

706
00:30:28,064 --> 00:30:29,933
THIS IS WHAT I HAVE TO OFFER."

707
00:30:31,201 --> 00:30:34,638
♪♪♪

708
00:30:53,290 --> 00:30:55,525
THIS IS GONNA BE THE FINALE!

709
00:30:55,525 --> 00:30:56,593
SMILE, CLAP.

710
00:30:56,593 --> 00:30:57,661
LET'S GO.

711
00:31:04,568 --> 00:31:08,004
I'M SO OVERCOME WITH EVERY
SINGLE EMOTION THAT LAST WALK

712
00:31:08,004 --> 00:31:11,274
THAT I CAN'T EVEN HOLD A BEAT
WHEN I'M CLAPPING.

713
00:31:27,424 --> 00:31:28,425
AMAZING!

714
00:31:28,425 --> 00:31:29,526
THAT WAS AMAZING.

715
00:31:29,526 --> 00:31:31,461
YOU GIRLS ROCKED!

716
00:31:31,461 --> 00:31:33,797
DO YOU WANT A HUG?
NO, I DON'T WANT A HUG.

717
00:31:33,797 --> 00:31:34,898
YOU GIRLS WORKED IT OUT.

718
00:31:34,898 --> 00:31:37,400
GOOD JOB, GOOD JOB,
GOOD JOB.

719
00:31:37,400 --> 00:31:39,336
CAN WE GET THEM A TOWEL?

720
00:31:39,336 --> 00:31:41,671
THAT'S WHAT I'M
TALKING ABOUT.

721
00:31:41,671 --> 00:31:43,974
MY GOD.

722
00:31:43,974 --> 00:31:47,110
GIVE ME SOME LOVE!

723
00:31:47,110 --> 00:31:48,678
AND ALL OF THAT IN THE END,
YOU GUYS!

724
00:31:48,678 --> 00:31:49,846
AND ALL OF THAT WATER.

725
00:31:49,846 --> 00:31:51,815
THEY DID
A GOOD JOB, RIGHT?

726
00:31:51,815 --> 00:31:53,316
I'M PROUD.

727
00:31:53,316 --> 00:31:54,417
GOOD JOB.

728
00:31:54,417 --> 00:31:55,785
THANK YOU.

729
00:31:55,785 --> 00:31:57,487
I'M VERY PROUD.

730
00:31:57,487 --> 00:31:59,889
MAMA'S PROUD.

731
00:31:59,889 --> 00:32:03,126
NOW WE CAN BE FRIENDS AGAIN.

732
00:32:06,930 --> 00:32:10,400
TO OUR FIRST FASHION SHOW,
ALWAYS IN OUR MEMORIES.

733
00:32:10,400 --> 00:32:14,004
OVERALL IN THIS COMPETITION,
I THINK I ROCKED.

734
00:32:14,004 --> 00:32:15,405
I REALLY DO.

735
00:32:15,405 --> 00:32:18,375
I THINK KAHLEN HAS
A LOT OF NATURAL ABILITY

736
00:32:18,375 --> 00:32:20,310
THAT I DON'T HAVE.

737
00:32:20,310 --> 00:32:23,046
BUT I FELT LIKE
I WAS THE STAR OF THAT SHOW.

738
00:32:23,046 --> 00:32:24,014
TYRA MAIL.

739
00:32:26,883 --> 00:32:28,685
"TOMORROW YOU WILL MEET
WITH THE JUDGES,

740
00:32:28,685 --> 00:32:32,789
ONLY ONE OF YOU WILL BECOME
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL."

741
00:32:34,190 --> 00:32:37,727
KAHLEN, YOU ARE THE GREATEST
MODEL IN THE WORLD.

742
00:32:37,727 --> 00:32:40,664
NAIMA, YOUR WALK TONIGHT
WAS BEAUTIFUL.

743
00:32:45,802 --> 00:32:47,070
WELCOME, LADIES.

744
00:32:47,070 --> 00:32:50,306
TODAY IS A VERY SPECIAL
JUDGING DAY, ISN'T IT?

745
00:32:50,306 --> 00:32:52,609
IT'S THE FINAL JUDGING DAY.

746
00:32:52,609 --> 00:32:57,347
WE ARE GONNA DECIDE WHO WILL BE
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

747
00:32:57,347 --> 00:33:00,550
YOU GUYS HAVE COME
A LONG, LONG WAY--

748
00:33:00,550 --> 00:33:07,023
ONE GIRL FROM DETROIT, MICHIGAN,
AND THE OTHER FROM OKLAHOMA!

749
00:33:08,358 --> 00:33:10,727
BUT NOW IT IS TIME FOR YOU ALL
TO TAKE EVERYTHING

750
00:33:10,727 --> 00:33:14,731
THAT WE HAVE TAUGHT YOU
AND GRADUATE INTO THE REAL WORLD

751
00:33:14,731 --> 00:33:18,234
OF MODELING
AS AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

752
00:33:18,234 --> 00:33:21,237
NOW, OF COURSE, YOU GUYS HAVE
BEEN HEARING ABOUT THE FABULOUS

753
00:33:21,237 --> 00:33:22,839
PRIZES FOR WEEKS ON END.

754
00:33:22,839 --> 00:33:24,841
BUT TONIGHT THEY'RE REAL
AND THEY'RE TANGIBLE,

755
00:33:24,841 --> 00:33:27,444
BECAUSE ONE OF YOU
IS GONNA WALK AWAY WITH THEM.

756
00:33:27,444 --> 00:33:30,346
THE FIRST IS A CONTRACT
WITH TOP INTERNATIONAL MODEL

757
00:33:30,346 --> 00:33:32,849
MANAGEMENT COMPANY--
FORD MODELS--

758
00:33:32,849 --> 00:33:35,452
A SPREAD IN "ELLE" MAGAZINE,
WHICH WILL BE SHOT BY

759
00:33:35,452 --> 00:33:38,688
WORLD-RENOWNED PHOTOGRAPHER
GILLES BESIMON

760
00:33:38,688 --> 00:33:43,727
AND A $100,000 CONTRACT
WITH COVER GIRL COSMETICS.

761
00:33:43,727 --> 00:33:46,062
AS YOU GUYS CAN SEE TONIGHT,
THERE IS NO GUEST JUDGE.

762
00:33:46,062 --> 00:33:47,864
BECAUSE WHO KNOWS YOU BETTER
BUT US FOUR?

763
00:33:47,864 --> 00:33:50,266
THE FIRST JUDGE
JANICE DICKINSON,

764
00:33:50,266 --> 00:33:52,402
ONE OF THE WORLD'S FIRST
SUPERMODELS,

765
00:33:52,402 --> 00:33:55,171
NIGEL BARKER
NOTED FASHION PHOTOGRAPHER,

766
00:33:55,171 --> 00:33:59,142
NOLé MARIN PROMINENT
FASHION EDITOR AND STYLIST.

767
00:33:59,142 --> 00:34:01,177
SO NOW IT'S TIME
FOR YOUR EVALUATIONS.

768
00:34:01,177 --> 00:34:04,114
THEN THE JUDGES WILL DELIBERATE,
THEN WE'LL DETERMINE

769
00:34:04,114 --> 00:34:07,617
WHICH OF YOU SHOULD BE
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

770
00:34:07,617 --> 00:34:10,120
YOU GUYS HAD TO COMPETE
IN A FASHION SHOW.

771
00:34:10,120 --> 00:34:12,622
NAIMA, CAME OUT FIRST
AND HERE SHE IS.

772
00:34:12,622 --> 00:34:14,890
YOU SCARED ME WHEN YOU CAME OUT
BUT IN A GOOD WAY.

773
00:34:14,890 --> 00:34:15,892
LIKE, I WAS IN SHOCK.

774
00:34:15,892 --> 00:34:17,292
I WAS IN AWE.

775
00:34:17,292 --> 00:34:20,997
I WAS LIKE, "IS THAT BEYONCE
MORPHED INTO A TOP MODEL?"

776
00:34:20,997 --> 00:34:22,732
KAHLEN'S FIRST PASSAGE.

777
00:34:22,732 --> 00:34:24,267
THAT'S SO GREAT.

778
00:34:24,267 --> 00:34:25,869
YOU LOOK LIKE MODELS.

779
00:34:25,869 --> 00:34:27,870
WHEN YOU STARTED WALKING,
I THOUGHT YOU WERE FIERCE.

780
00:34:27,870 --> 00:34:29,238
I FELT THE STOMP.

781
00:34:29,238 --> 00:34:32,975
YOU ABSOLUTELY HAD
THE GALLIANO WALK FROM PARIS.

782
00:34:32,975 --> 00:34:34,511
NAIMA,
YOU COMMANDED THAT RUNWAY.

783
00:34:34,511 --> 00:34:35,611
IT WAS JUST FLAWLESS.

784
00:34:35,611 --> 00:34:36,913
IT LOOKED LIKE A VERSACE SHOW.

785
00:34:36,913 --> 00:34:38,680
KAHLEN, YOUR MOUTH
WOULD GET REALLY TENSE WITH IT

786
00:34:38,680 --> 00:34:40,149
AND YOUR NECK GETS REALLY STIFF.

787
00:34:40,149 --> 00:34:42,151
TRUTH OF THE MATTER,
I BELIEVE YOU HAVE A BETTER

788
00:34:42,151 --> 00:34:45,522
BATHING-SUIT PROPORTIONED BODY
TO NAIMA'S.

789
00:34:45,522 --> 00:34:46,990
YOU GUYS WERE FABULOUS.

790
00:34:46,990 --> 00:34:49,058
I AM SO PROUD
OF BOTH OF YOU.

791
00:34:49,058 --> 00:34:51,528
SO YOU GUYS HAVE HAD A LOT
OF PHOTO SHOOTS AND RIGHT NOW

792
00:34:51,528 --> 00:34:54,129
WE'RE GONNA COMPARE THEM--
KAHLEN'S PHOTO

793
00:34:54,129 --> 00:34:56,966
VERSUS NAIMA'S PHOTO--
STARTING WITH WEEK ONE,

794
00:34:56,966 --> 00:34:58,600
WHERE WE MADE YOU ALIENS.

795
00:34:58,600 --> 00:35:00,736
NOW I REMEMBER
SHOOTING BOTH OF YOU GIRLS.

796
00:35:00,736 --> 00:35:03,106
YOU WERE TWO OF MY FAVORITES--
DIFFERENT,

797
00:35:03,106 --> 00:35:05,341
BUT BOTH VERY INTERESTING.
NEXT SHOOT,

798
00:35:05,341 --> 00:35:07,177
YOU POSED WITH A LOT OF DOGS.

799
00:35:07,177 --> 00:35:09,045
WHAT I LOVE ABOUT YOU KAHLEN
IS YOUR MOUTH.

800
00:35:09,045 --> 00:35:11,014
A LOT OF MODELS IN THE '70s
HAD THAT THAT TYPE OF, LIKE,

801
00:35:11,014 --> 00:35:12,982
KIND OF POUTY MOUTH.

802
00:35:12,982 --> 00:35:14,217
NAIMA'S SHOT.

803
00:35:14,217 --> 00:35:15,785
IT IS A MEDIOCRE SHOT.

804
00:35:15,785 --> 00:35:19,556
THE MOHAWK I FEEL WENT OUT
IN THE LATE '90s.

805
00:35:19,556 --> 00:35:22,325
SO THIS PHOTO SHOOT
WAS DEALING WITH THE ELEMENTS--

806
00:35:22,325 --> 00:35:24,093
WITH WIND AND RAIN.

807
00:35:24,093 --> 00:35:26,095
VERY SEXY PICTURE,
YOU KNOW, THERE'S A LOT OF GUYS

808
00:35:26,095 --> 00:35:27,597
THAT WOULD LIKE TO PIN THIS UP
ON THEIR WALL.

809
00:35:27,597 --> 00:35:28,898
NAIMA'S SHOT.

810
00:35:28,898 --> 00:35:31,267
I LIKE THE TOMBOY-ESQUENESS
OF IT, THAT'S IT'S SEXY,

811
00:35:31,267 --> 00:35:34,470
BUT IT'S, I'M GONNA BEAT YOUR
BUTT, TOO, AT THE SAME TIME.

812
00:35:34,470 --> 00:35:37,874
THIS PHOTO SHOOT
WAS SEVEN DEADLY SINS.

813
00:35:37,874 --> 00:35:41,878
NAIMA WAS ENVY
AND KAHLEN WAS WRATH!

814
00:35:41,878 --> 00:35:43,680
LOVE, LOVE, LOVE.

815
00:35:43,680 --> 00:35:44,914
FLAWLESS.

816
00:35:44,914 --> 00:35:46,783
YOU LOOK IT UP
IN THE DICTIONARY WRATH,

817
00:35:46,783 --> 00:35:49,185
THIS IS WHAT YOU WOULD SEE.

818
00:35:49,185 --> 00:35:51,054
NAIMA'S SHOT.

819
00:35:51,054 --> 00:35:53,223
I JUST THINK YOU COULD HAVE
DONE MORE WITH YOUR FACE.

820
00:35:53,223 --> 00:35:55,658
KAHLEN PULLED IT OUT MORE.

821
00:35:55,658 --> 00:35:57,493
WELCOME
TO WILD KINGDOM, LADIES.

822
00:35:57,493 --> 00:35:59,462
THESE SHOTS WERE FABULOUS.

823
00:35:59,462 --> 00:36:01,898
KAHLEN, YOU ARE A SPRINGBOK
IN THIS PICTURE,

824
00:36:01,898 --> 00:36:03,199
THE ESSENCE OF A WILD ANIMAL.

825
00:36:03,199 --> 00:36:04,234
YOU NAILED THIS PICTURE.

826
00:36:04,234 --> 00:36:05,702
NAIMA'S SHOT.

827
00:36:05,702 --> 00:36:08,104
ON "AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL,"
WE'VE HAD TWO GIRLS IN THE PAST

828
00:36:08,104 --> 00:36:11,074
THAT WERE DANCERS,
AND IT'S VERY DIFFICULT

829
00:36:11,074 --> 00:36:13,643
TO BREAK THEM
FROM LOOKING LIKE A DANCER,

830
00:36:13,643 --> 00:36:16,913
AND YOU KNOW HOW
TO BALANCE IT SO WELL.

831
00:36:16,913 --> 00:36:18,414
NEXT PHOTO SHOOT.

832
00:36:18,414 --> 00:36:20,316
THIS WAS KIND OF LIKE
AN AFRICAN PARTY.

833
00:36:20,316 --> 00:36:22,252
NAIMA'S PHOTO FIRST.

834
00:36:22,252 --> 00:36:23,786
THE BODY LANGUAGE
IS FANTASTIC.

835
00:36:23,786 --> 00:36:25,688
YOU WERE THE STAR OF THAT PHOTO.

836
00:36:25,688 --> 00:36:28,591
THIS IS YOUR BEST HEAD SHOT.

837
00:36:28,591 --> 00:36:30,360
KIND OF LOOKED LIKE YOU WERE
DANCING ALL NIGHT LONG

838
00:36:30,360 --> 00:36:32,695
AND YOU DIDN'T TAKE A BREAK.

839
00:36:32,795 --> 00:36:34,764
SO THIS NEXT WEEK'S
PHOTO SHOOT WAS A COVER GIRL

840
00:36:34,764 --> 00:36:36,065
PHOTO SHOOT.

841
00:36:36,065 --> 00:36:38,801
THE WINNER OF THE COMPETITION,
THIS IS GONNA BE YOUR AD

842
00:36:38,801 --> 00:36:40,837
THAT'S GONNA RUN
IN NATIONAL MAGAZINES.

843
00:36:40,837 --> 00:36:43,206
I READ EVERY MAGAZINE,
AND I WOULD STOP

844
00:36:43,206 --> 00:36:44,407
AT THIS PHOTOGRAPH.

845
00:36:44,407 --> 00:36:46,409
IT'S ABSOLUTELY STUNNING.

846
00:36:46,409 --> 00:36:47,744
NAIMA'S SHOT.

847
00:36:47,744 --> 00:36:49,279
THIS IS THE COVER GIRL SHOT
FOR ME.

848
00:36:49,279 --> 00:36:51,281
HOWEVER, I DON'T LIKE
THIS PICTURE AS MUCH

849
00:36:51,281 --> 00:36:52,849
AS KAHLEN'S PICTURE.

850
00:36:52,849 --> 00:36:54,617
TELL ME, KAHLEN,
WHY DO YOU THINK YOU SHOULD BE

851
00:36:54,617 --> 00:36:56,119
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL?

852
00:36:56,119 --> 00:36:59,923
'CAUSE I THINK I'VE OVERCOME
SO MUCH OF WHO I AM.

853
00:36:59,923 --> 00:37:02,058
I'VE OVERCOME
SITTING IN THE CORNER

854
00:37:02,058 --> 00:37:06,162
AND NOT BEING THAT PRETTY GIRL
AND BEING OVERLOOKED

855
00:37:06,162 --> 00:37:10,066
TIME AND TIME AGAIN
AND NEVER BEING GOOD ENOUGH.

856
00:37:10,066 --> 00:37:11,701
WHAT ABOUT YOU, NAIMA,
WHY DO YOU THINK YOU SHOULD BE

857
00:37:11,701 --> 00:37:13,236
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL?

858
00:37:15,772 --> 00:37:17,206
IT'S OKAY.

859
00:37:17,206 --> 00:37:18,408
I HATED MYSELF.

860
00:37:18,408 --> 00:37:20,343
I HATED THIS GIRL.

861
00:37:20,343 --> 00:37:21,878
THAT WAS MY LOWEST POINT, TYRA.

862
00:37:23,680 --> 00:37:26,316
I WALKED IN HERE TODAY
AND I FELT BEAUTIFUL.

863
00:37:26,316 --> 00:37:28,851
YOU GUYS ARE PROOF
THAT MODELS AREN'T SHELLS.

864
00:37:28,851 --> 00:37:31,487
THAT THEY ARE TRUE PEOPLE
WITH FEELINGS AND EMOTIONS

865
00:37:31,487 --> 00:37:35,325
AND PASTS AND INSECURITIES,
BEAUTIFUL FROM THE INSIDE OUT.

866
00:37:35,325 --> 00:37:38,294
AND YOU'RE PROVING THAT
TO A LOT OF PEOPLE RIGHT NOW.

867
00:37:38,294 --> 00:37:40,063
SO WHEN I CALL YOU BACK,
I'M GONNA ANNOUNCE WHO'S GONNA

868
00:37:40,063 --> 00:37:41,664
BE AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

869
00:37:44,233 --> 00:37:47,136
SO WE HAVE
TWO PORTFOLIOS HERE

870
00:37:47,136 --> 00:37:50,573
AND TWO VERY STRONG CANDIDATES.

871
00:37:50,573 --> 00:37:51,808
KAHLEN.

872
00:37:51,808 --> 00:37:53,576
KAHLEN--
WHAT A BEAUTIFUL GIRL.

873
00:37:53,576 --> 00:37:56,212
YOU KNOW, PHOTOGRAPHICALLY
KAHLEN'S DONE AN AMAZING JOB.

874
00:37:56,212 --> 00:37:59,549
KAHLEN DEFINITELY
IS PHOTOGENIC, BUT IN PERSON,

875
00:37:59,549 --> 00:38:02,352
SHE JUST LOOKS DRY.

876
00:38:02,352 --> 00:38:05,088
THIS IS WHAT THE PROS DO,
EVERYBODY.

877
00:38:05,088 --> 00:38:08,057
EACH PHOTOGRAPH
SHOWS A DIFFERENT SIDE

878
00:38:08,057 --> 00:38:09,392
OF VERSATILITY.

879
00:38:09,392 --> 00:38:10,927
I CAN CALL UP ANY ONE
ONE OF THESE AGENCIES SAYING I

880
00:38:10,927 --> 00:38:14,497
WANT A BLONDE CASTING AND GET
LOTS OF GIRLS WITH GOOD WORKING

881
00:38:14,497 --> 00:38:15,965
PORTFOLIOS WHO ARE BLONDE.

882
00:38:15,965 --> 00:38:17,667
I THINK YOU'RE BEING A LITTLE
BIT STEREOTYPICAL SAYING

883
00:38:17,667 --> 00:38:19,502
SHE'S JUST A BLONDE-HAIRED,
BLUE-EYED GIRL.

884
00:38:19,502 --> 00:38:20,970
KAHLEN HAS SOMETHING SPECIAL.

885
00:38:20,970 --> 00:38:23,239
SHE'S AN EDGY BLONDE-HAIR,
BLUE-EYED GIRL.

886
00:38:23,239 --> 00:38:25,575
KAHLEN'S BODY PROPORTIONS
ARE PERFECT

887
00:38:25,575 --> 00:38:27,043
FOR A DESIGNER'S MUSE.

888
00:38:27,043 --> 00:38:29,612
I WAS VERSACE'S MUSE.

